- Persist video job state and generated files.
- Ensure jobs work across instance restarts.
- Restrict access to private videos and reports.
- Validate rendering inputs and use safe FFmpeg process execution.

## 35. AI API protection

Protect every AI endpoint.

- Keep model credentials server-side.
- Require authentication for private or expensive operations.
- Apply per-user and per-IP rate limits.
- Apply quotas and usage budgets.
- Limit input and output sizes.
- Use bounded concurrency and timeouts.
- Validate structured AI responses.
